{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MassTheory.TrefoilColoringBarEven","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MassTheory.TrefoilColoringBarEven","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.trefoilColoring_eq_zero_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.trefoilColoring_eq_zero_iff","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/TrefoilColoringBarEven.lean#L52-L58","doc":"**Reducibility locus.** `c(m) = 0` exactly when `m⁴ − m² + 1 = 0` (the Alexander-polynomial roots\n`m² = e^{±iπ/3}`) — the boundary between reducible and irreducible representations. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.trefoilColoring_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.trefoilColoring_one","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/TrefoilColoringBarEven.lean#L47-L50","doc":"**Flat/pinched value.** At the parabolic meridian `m = 1` the coloring is `c = −1` (the flat rep,\n`c + 1 = 0`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.trefoilColoring_add_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.trefoilColoring_add_one","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/TrefoilColoringBarEven.lean#L38-L45","doc":"**The coloring's deviation from flat is an exact bar-even square:** `c(m) + 1 = −(m − m⁻¹)²`.\nSince `m − m⁻¹` is bar-odd (`m ↦ m⁻¹` negates it), the deviation is bar-**even** — the parity of the\n`g₂` correction; at `m = q₀` it equals `−(q₀ − q₀⁻¹)² = −h²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassTheory.trefoilColoring","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassTheory.trefoilColoring","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MassTheory/TrefoilColoringBarEven.lean#L34-L36","doc":"The trefoil boundary-parabolic **coloring** `c(m) = −(m⁴ − m² + 1)/m²` — the off-diagonal entry of\n`ρ(v)` forced by the braid relation `uvu = vuv`, as a function of the meridian eigenvalue `m`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}